Tenant: This must be the Azure AD (Microsoft Entra ID) authority endpoint, which is:
https://login.microsoftonline.com/&lt;Tenant-GUID&gt;
This URL allows the Azure VPN gateway to redirect users to authenticate via Microsoft Entra.

Issuer: This should be the token issuer claim from the ID token issued by Microsoft Entra. The correct value is:
https://sts.windows.net/&lt;Tenant-GUID&gt;
This is used by the VPN gateway to validate the token's issuer during authentication.
